 a standard document that includes service dates; while the dated_documents list only highlights the closing documents, the invoice itself is provided and, together with the plumber invoice and photos, establishes remediation timing shortly after the incident.","evidence":"supporting_documents includes \"Water mitigation company invoice\"; timeline.days_incident_to_filing=1; supporting_documents includes \"Plumber invoice\",\"Photos of damage (10)\""}],"points":[{"id":"D1","point":"The loss falls within HO\u20113 coverage for sudden and accidental water damage, and the policy was active on the incident date.","evidence":"policy.type=HO-3; policy.start_date=2025-01-10; incident.date=2025-02-03"},{"id":"D2","point":"The claim is substantiated by contemporaneous plumber and mitigation invoices and ten photos, demonstrating actual repair work and costs.","evidence":"supporting_documents includes \"Plumber invoice\",\"Water mitigation company invoice\",\"Photos of damage (10)\"; timeline.days_incident_to_filing=1"},{"id":"D3","point":"There is no prior claim history and the incident occurred at the insured residence, supporting the claim\u2019s legitimacy.","evidence":"claim_history.prior_claims_count=0; location.incident_address_matches_insured_property=true; location.same_city_as_home=true"}],"summary":"The policy was active and covers sudden water damage, the claimant provided credible invoices and photos, and there is no prior claim history, so the loss is genuine and should be approved."}

